From: Erik Faye-Lund <erik.faye-lund@collabora.com>
Subject: [PATCH] panfrost: backport the upstream Mali-G715 model and rates

Combine the G715 model entry from 73210bf69dfa4cfb5d5c5b3b7c6c91a05209e2b6
with its corrected rates from b057153fb11d130c5efe665cd0bc04bd1d9be737.
The model entry alone is insufficient; the accompanying patches provide
architecture 11 support. Source files retain their MIT license.

Backport scope: retain only the G715 row. Omit the G615 row and the
panfrost.rst/new_features.txt documentation hunks from 73210bf; neither
is needed for the Pixel 9a. The rate fix is applied only to that retained
row. No changes to the existing G710, G68 or G78 entries.

